          "content": {
            "id": "d06e7454-47fb-37f4-a73f-90b9f7b956cc",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "US stocks rebound on US-China trade latest, Big Bank earnings on deck",
            "description": "<p><a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/julie-hyman/\">Julie Hyman</a> outlines three things investors are watching on Monday, Oct. 13.</p>\n<p>US stock futures (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/ES%3DF\">ES=F</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NQ%3DF\">NQ=F</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/YM%3DF\">YM=F</a>) rebound after Trump signaled a willingness to negotiate with China. The president's comments on US-China trade talks are a shift from his comments on Friday, which sent equities tumbling by roughly $2 trillion. Investors are watching for Big Bank earnings with Goldman Sachs (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GS\">GS</a>), JPMorgan Chase (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/JPM\">JPM</a>), Wells Fargo (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/WFC\">WFC</a>), and Citi (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/C\">C</a>) reporting on Tuesday.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:9;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/morning-brief/\">Morning Brief</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "Julie Hyman outlines three things investors are watching on Monday, Oct. 13. US stock futures (ES=F, NQ=F, YM=F) rebound after Trump signaled a willingness to negotiate with China. The president's comments on US-China trade talks are a shift from his comments on Friday, which sent equities tumbling by roughly $2 trillion. Investors are watching for Big Bank earnings with Goldman Sachs (GS), JPMorgan Chase (JPM), Wells Fargo (WFC), and Citi (C) reporting on Tuesday. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more Morning Brief.",
